{
  "_comment": [
    "Allow rules read by ~/.claude/hooks/smart_approve.py only. Claude Code never parses this file.",
    "These rules carry a wildcard before the subcommand, which Claude Code 2.1.246+ warns about at startup when it sits in settings.json permissions.allow. See the project CLAUDE.md \"Gotchas\" for the full rule, including why deny and ask rules stay in settings.json."
  ],
